nd remote server side, and B6 has\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.stack.md:903:- B6 request/response schema and contract stamps.\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:25:                       [\"@noble/hashes/blake3.js\" :as noble-blake3]\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:28:                       [\"package:blake3_dart/blake3_dart.dart\"\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:29:                        :as blake3-dart]]))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:49:  \"Print an order-normalized value following Clojure's printing conventions\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:152:(defn- order-normalized-print\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:153:  \"Transitional encoder: canonical-print over the order-normalized form,\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:208:             (convert/utf8.encode s))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:275:  \"SHA-256 hex digest of the UTF-8 bytes of string s. Every host digests\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:280:  #?(:clj (let [digest (java.security.MessageDigest/getInstance \"SHA-256\")\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:293:  \"SHA-256 hex digest of host bytes bs (byte[] on the JVM, Uint8Array on\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:297:  #?(:clj (let [digest (java.security.MessageDigest/getInstance \"SHA-256\")\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:309:(def default-hash-algorithm\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:310:  \"The default algorithm used for implicit minting (content-hash, segment-key,\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:312:  :blake3)\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:318:  {:blake3 {:address-id \"blake3\", :digest-bytes 32}\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:335:(defn blake3-bytes\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:339:  #?(:clj (let [b (io.github.rctcwyvrn.blake3.Blake3/newInstance)]\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:342:     :cljs (noble-utils/bytesToHex (noble-blake3/blake3 bs))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:346:             (blake3-dart/blake3Hex u8))))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:349:(defn blake3\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:352:  #?(:clj (let [b (io.github.rctcwyvrn.blake3.Blake3/newInstance)]\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:355:     :cljs (blake3-bytes (noble-utils/utf8ToBytes s))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing.cljc:356:     :cljd (blake3-bytes (convert/utf